B.aIs=new A.c(B.M_,["Acquire a durable industrial-services operator and preserve the existing management team while professionalizing reporting and finance.","Established B2B service company with recurring commercial accounts, defensible local relationships, and limited customer concentration.","Experienced operating team expected to remain after closing; owner transition support is preferred.","$3M\u2013$5M annual revenue","$500K\u2013$800K normalized EBITDA","Combination of buyer equity, acquisition debt, and a potential vendor note.","Targeting exclusivity within 60\u201390 days.","Earnings quality, customer concentration, working capital, management continuity, and environmental exposure.","Share or asset purchase remains open; meaningful transition support is preferred."],t.w)
B.aIt=new A.c(B.M_,["Acquire a recurring-revenue home-services platform with a stable customer base and clear opportunities for operational improvement.","Owner-operated residential services company with repeat customers and an established local brand.","Buyer expects to retain key technicians and needs a practical owner-transition plan.","$1M\u2013$2M annual revenue","$200K\u2013$350K normalized EBITDA","Buyer equity plus senior acquisition financing.","Flexible close after diligence and financing approval.","Earnings normalization, technician retention, seasonality, customer churn, and fleet condition.","Asset purchase preferred, subject to tax and legal review."],t.w)
